{'symbol': 'ORCL', 'date': '2023-06-28 08:00:00', 'title': 'ORACLE INTRODUCES GENERATIVE AI CAPABILITIES TO HELP HR BOOST PRODUCTIVITY', 'text': 'NEW GENERATIVE AI-POWERED CAPABILITIES IN ORACLE FUSION CLOUD\xa0HCM ENHANCE EFFICIENCY AND STREAMLINE HR PROCESSES FOR CANDIDATES, EMPLOYEES, MANAGERS, AND RECRUITERS AUSTIN, TEXAS , JUNE 28, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ORACLE TODAY ANNOUNCED THE ADDITION OF GENERATIVE AI-POWERED CAPABILITIES WITHIN ORACLE FUSION CLOUD HUMAN CAPITAL MANAGEMENT (HCM). SUPPORTED BY THE ORACLE CLOUD INFRASTRUCTURE (OCI)\xa0GENERATIVE AI SERVICE, THE NEW CAPABILITIES ARE EMBEDDED IN EXISTING HR PROCESSES TO DRIVE FASTER BUSINESS VALUE, IMPROVE PRODUCTIVITY, ENHANCE THE CANDIDATE AND EMPLOYEE EXPERIENCE, AND STREAMLINE HR PROCESSES.'}